pass the theater of corporate capture that currently defines Washington’s regulatory approach. Worker-led collectives are incentivized to ensure that AI integration is additive to their capabilities rather than subtractive to their livelihoods. This model transforms the governance of technology from a top-down bureaucratic gatekeeping exercise into a bottom-up mechanism for collective empowerment, ensuring that the fruits of technological change are distributed at the point of production.",
